                                                "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
                                                "text": "Aliens have a nefarious connotation in many science fiction books."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d022cd16-b1c5-48b9-8f0d-6fbd820d1dd0",
                                                "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
                                                "text": "\"If the vessel be no fair-trading slaver, nor a common cruiser of his Majesty, it is as tangible as the best man's reasoning, that she may be neither more nor less than the ship of that nefarious pirate the Red Rover.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df001a74-bb30-4e86-aea9-487932b899c4",
                                                "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
                                                "text": "Mommsen […]declares that Catiline in particular was \"one of the most nefarious men in that nefarious age. His villanies belong to the criminal records, not to history.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "453aa0db-b52c-49fd-a62b-a63f38e28dc9",
                                                "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
                                                "text": "The fact that the room was still in darkness made it obvious that something nefarious was afoot. Plainly there was dirty work in preparation at the cross-roads."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f385b39b-409e-481c-82e9-7b415efcea91",
                                                "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
